# What a Vercel deployment uploads. When this file exists the Vercel CLI uses it
# in place of .gitignore, so the built game in web/game/ (git-ignored) is uploaded.
# Everything is left out except the page, the one function and what it imports.
/*
!/web
!/api
!/server
!/vercel.json
!/package.json
/server/test
/web/test
/web/game/test.html
